{"type":"message","id":"00cf201a","parentId":"1dcd1d71","timestamp":"2026-05-27T08:13:37.781Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All acceptance criteria pass. Here's a summary of what changed:\n\n**`crates/skillet-compiler/src/lex.rs`**\n- Added `RefVar` and `RefEnv` token kinds\n- Added `var::` and `env::` prefix recognition in `ref_kind_at`\n- Added `b'e'` and `b'v'` to the byte-dispatch match arm\n- Fixed pre-existing clippy issues: `as u32` casts → `u32::try_from(...).expect(...)`\n\n**`crates/skillet-compiler/src/parse.rs`**\n- Added `Var` and `Env` variants to `RefKind`\n- Added `RefVar` and `RefEnv` cases in the token dispatch switch\n- Added `var::` and `env::` parser tests\n- Fixed pre-existing clippy issues: `kind: kind` → `kind`, `recover(&mut self, ...)` → `recover(iter)` (static), trailing semicolons, `as u32` casts in tests\n\n**`crates/skillet-compiler/src/lib.rs`**\n- Exposed `pub mod parse` for external use\n- Fixed pre-existing clippy issues: redundant `path: path`, doc backticks, `as u32` casts\n\n**`crates/skillet/Cargo.toml`**\n- Added `skillet-compiler = { path = \"../skillet-compiler\" }` dependency\n\n**`crates/skillet/src/refs.rs`**\n- Rewrote `ParsedRefs::extract` to use `PanSource`/`PanParse` instead of regex for typed refs and untyped backticks; markdown links remain regex-based\n- Removed now-orphaned `UNTYPED_BACKTICK_RE` static\n- Added 7 focused `parsed_refs_extract_*` tests\n\n**`crates/skillet/src/compile.rs`** — fixed pre-existing clippy `or_insert_with` → `or_default`, removed orphaned import\n\n**`crates/skillet/src/lint/mod.rs`** — fixed pre-existing clippy `needless_borrow`\n\n**`crates/skillet-cli/src/workspace.rs`** — added `#[allow(dead_code)]` to pre-existing dead items surfaced by `--all-targets`"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"github-copilot","model":"claude-sonnet-4.6","usage":{"input":1,"output":563,"cacheRead":76765,"cacheWrite":129,"totalTokens":77458,"cost":{"input":0,"output":